---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Bevita — Your Health, Remembered"
  description="A personal health record that remembers your story. Upload labs, track symptoms, get AI insights — built by a doctor, for people too busy to think about health full-time."
>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="shell">
      <span class="eyebrow">smart health monitor</span>
      <h1>Your health,<br/>remembered.</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        ChatGPT forgets your last lab. We don't. Bevita is a personal health record
        that connects symptoms to labs, reminds you what's overdue, and builds
        a timeline your doctor can actually use.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-cta">
        <a href="#download" class="btn btn-primary">Download for free</a>
        <a href="#how-it-works" class="btn btn-ghost">See how it works</a>
      </div>
      <p class="hero-note">Free tier · No credit card required · iOS & Android</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Problem -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="shell">
      <span class="eyebrow">the problem</span>
      <h2>Your health story<br/>lives in 5 places</h2>
      <div class="problem-grid">
        <div class="problem-card">
          <span class="problem-icon">📁</span>
          <h4>Paper folders</h4>
          <p>Lab results from 2023 buried somewhere. You can't find them when the new doctor asks.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="problem-card">
          <span class="problem-icon">🏥</span>
          <h4>Clinic portals</h4>
          <p>Each clinic has its own system. Your data is siloed across 3-4 different accounts.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="problem-card">
          <span class="problem-icon">🧠</span>
          <h4>ChatGPT</h4>
          <p>Great for single questions. Terrible at remembering your last ferritin result from 6 months ago.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="problem-card">
          <span class="problem-icon">⏰</span>
          <h4>Good intentions</h4>
          <p>You mean to follow up. Then 9 months pass and you've forgotten what was even flagged.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- How it works -->
  <section id="how-it-works" class="section section-tinted">
    <div class="shell">
      <span class="eyebrow">how it works</span>
      <h2>Three steps.<br/>Your entire health timeline.</h2>
      <div class="steps">
        <div class="step">
          <span class="step-num">01</span>
          <h3>Upload anything</h3>
          <p>Photo of a paper lab report, PDF from your clinic portal, ultrasound results, doctor's notes. Bevita reads them all.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <span class="step-num">02</span>
          <h3>AI connects the dots</h3>
          <p>Bevita doesn't just read your latest result in isolation. It retrieves your history, finds patterns across years and test types, and tells you what it means.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <span class="step-num">03</span>
          <h3>Share with your doctor</h3>
          <p>Export a clean PDF Health Passport — everything organized, trends highlighted, questions ready. Hand it to your doctor instead of a folder of papers.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Features -->
  <section id="features" class="section">
    <div class="shell">
      <span class="eyebrow">features</span>
      <h2>Built for people who<br/>want to stay ahead.</h2>
      <div class="features-grid">
        <div class="feature-card">
          <h3>Long-term memory</h3>
          <p>Every upload, every finding, every symptom — stored and searchable. Ask "what about my liver?" and get answers across 3 years of data.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <h3>Symptom journal</h3>
          <p>Tap where it hurts on a body map. Log symptoms with location, type, intensity. Bevita maps them against your biomarkers and suggests which doctor to see.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <h3>Smart reminders</h3>
          <p>"Your last full panel was 9 months ago." "Your symptom journal shows fatigue 3+ times — check ferritin." Proactive, not reactive.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <h3>Health Passport PDF</h3>
          <p>Export a clinical-grade summary: all studies chronological, trend charts, AI-curated insights. Multi-language output. Ready for your next appointment.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <h3>Doctor share links</h3>
          <p>Generate a view-only URL for your doctor. They see your Health Passport in a clean web UI — no app install needed.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <h3>Built by a doctor</h3>
          <p>Not a tech team guessing at health features. A doctor who knows what patients actually need — and what doctors actually want to see.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Social proof -->
  <section class="section section-tight">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="proof">
        <div class="proof-stat">
          <span class="proof-num">7</span>
          <span class="proof-label">languages</span>
        </div>
        <div class="proof-divider"></div>
        <div class="proof-stat">
          <span class="proof-num">45+</span>
          <span class="proof-label">biomarkers tracked</span>
        </div>
        <div class="proof-divider"></div>
        <div class="proof-stat">
          <span class="proof-num">100%</span>
          <span class="proof-label">private & encrypted</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section id="download" class="section section-cta">
    <div class="shell">
      <h2>Your health deserves<br/>a better memory.</h2>
      <p class="lede">Start for free. Upload your first lab result in 30 seconds.</p>
      <div class="hero-cta">
        <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Download Bevita</a>
      </div>
      <div class="store-badges">
        <span class="store-badge">Coming to App Store</span>
        <span class="store-badge">Coming to Google Play</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <footer class="footer">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="footer-grid">
        <div class="footer-brand">
          <h4>Bevita</h4>
          <p>Your health, remembered.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-links">
          <h5>Product</h5>
          <a href="#features">Features</a>
          <a href="#how-it-works">How it works</a>
          <a href="#download">Download</a>
          <a href="/blog/">Blog</a>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-links">
          <h5>Legal</h5>
          <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>
          <a href="/terms/">Terms of Service</a>
          <a href="/medical/">Medical Disclaimer</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-bottom">
        <p>&copy; 2026 Bevita. Built with care by a doctor.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  /* Hero */
  .hero {
    padding: 120px 0 96px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .hero { padding: 80px 0 64px; } }
  .hero .lede { margin: 24px auto 0; max-width: 48ch; }
  .hero-cta { display: flex; gap: 12px; justify-content: center; margin-top: 32px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .hero-note { margin-top: 12px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-3); }

  /* Buttons */
  .btn {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 10px;
    padding: 16px 28px; border-radius: 999px;
    font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500;
    border: none; cursor: pointer;
    transition: transform .2s, background .2s, box-shadow .2s;
  }
  .btn-primary { background: var(--forest); color: var(--on-brand); }
  .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--forest-hover); transform: translateY(-1px); box-shadow: var(--shadow-emp); }
  .btn-ghost { background: transparent; color: var(--ink); border: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .btn-ghost:hover { border-color: var(--ink-3); }
  .btn-lg { padding: 20px 40px; font-size: 17px; }

  /* Sections */
  .shell { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }
  .section { padding: 96px 0; }
  .section-tight { padding: 64px 0; }
  .section-tinted { background: var(--tinted); }
  .section-cta { text-align: center; }
  .section-cta .lede { margin: 16px auto 0; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .section { padding: 64px 0; } }

  /* Eyebrow */
  .eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .18em;
    text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink-3); font-weight: 600;
    display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  /* Problem grid */
  .problem-grid {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
    gap: 24px; margin-top: 48px;
  }
  .problem-card {
    background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 32px; transition: box-shadow .2s;
  }
  .problem-card:hover { box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft); }
  .problem-icon { font-size: 32px; display: block; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .problem-card h4 { font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .problem-card p { font-size: 15px; }

  /* Steps */
  .steps {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 48px; margin-top: 48px;
  }
  .step-num {
    font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 48px; font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--forest-soft); line-height: 1; display: block; margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .step h3 { margin-bottom: 12px; }

  /* Features */
  .features-grid {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
    gap: 24px; margin-top: 48px;
  }
  .feature-card {
    background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 32px; transition: box-shadow .2s, border-color .2s;
  }
  .feature-card:hover { box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft); border-color: var(--forest-soft); }
  .feature-card h3 { font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: 8px; }

  /* Proof */
  .proof {
    display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center;
    gap: 48px; flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .proof-stat { text-align: center; }
  .proof-num { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 48px; color: var(--forest); display: block; }
  .proof-label { font-size: 14px; color: var(--ink-3); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .08em; }
  .proof-divider { width: 1px; height: 48px; background: var(--line); }

  /* Store badges */
  .store-badges { display: flex; gap: 12px; justify-content: center; margin-top: 24px; }
  .store-badge {
    padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 8px; background: var(--tinted);
    font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-3); font-weight: 500;
  }

  /* Footer */
  .footer { padding: 64px 0 32px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .footer-grid {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 48px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 32px; } }
  .footer-brand h4 { font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .footer-brand p { font-size: 14px; color: var(--ink-3); }
  .footer-links { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }
  .footer-links h5 { font-size: 13px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .08em; color: var(--ink-3); margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .footer-links a { font-size: 15px; color: var(--ink-2); }
  .footer-links a:hover { color: var(--forest); }
  .footer-bottom { margin-top: 48px; padding-top: 24px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .footer-bottom p { font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-3); }
</style>
